    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2761_10771.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unßeren fründtlichen gütwilligen dienst, und alles
<lb n="2"/>guets zevor, Frommen, vesten, fürsichtigen, weisen, be-
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sunders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geliebte</unclear> und getrüwe Burgermeister
<lb n="4"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mitrhat</unclear>. Demnach wir wol erfaren, dz H.
<lb n="5"/>altschriber <persName resp="#ner">Melchior Güldi</persName> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St. Gallen</placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuestand</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darinnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> sich leider befindt zue ver-
<lb n="7"/>ston gegeben, mit dienstlichem ersüchen, ihme da-
<lb n="8"/>hin befürdersam zesin, dz er zu gebürlicher ver-
<lb n="9"/>antwurtung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möge</unclear>. Haben wir nit
<lb n="10"/>umbgang <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nemen</unclear> wellen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zezüschriben</unclear>,
<lb n="11"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlichem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesinnen</unclear>, ir wellend mit und
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nebet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrengesandten</unclear> der übrigen 3. Evan-
<lb n="13"/>gelischen Stetten, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gsandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> ge-
<lb n="14"/>trüwen lieben eidtgnoßen, der Statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St. Gallen</placeName>, so
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrifft</unclear>- <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Baden</unclear></placeName> sein werden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansüchen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bei</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">intercediren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">H</unclear>. <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Güldi</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebürlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> verantwurtung begerender ge-
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stalten</unclear> gelangen möge. Welches dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bestem</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermesßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernunfften</unclear>, und gedachten herren von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St.
<lb n="20"/>Gallen</placeName> vorgehende bispil, war nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mülhau</unclear>-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschäffts</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sunder</unclear> auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eires</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">D</unclear>. von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St.
<lb n="22"/>Gallen</placeName> Buwren und anderen halben, uff mengen
<lb n="23"/>abgeschlagenen begereten verantwurt: und entschuldi-
<lb n="24"/>gung sich für <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungelegenheiten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erfolgt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemüet</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züfüeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oberen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhüetung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">viler</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weitläuffigkeit</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungelegenheiten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stattschriber</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Güldi</unclear></persName>
<lb n="28"/>in seinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sovil</unclear> sich imer thun laßt, auch
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Evangelischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stetten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> und gefallen, günstig
<lb n="30"/>ze willfahren, sich bewegen laßen werdint.
<lb n="31"/>Anderer zeitungen halben etc.
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ist</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züschriben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehebt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dath</unclear> den <origDate when="1629-06-26" resp="#ner">26.
<lb n="33"/>Junii. A.° 1629</origDate>.
<lb n="34"/>Den Frommen, vesten, fürsichtigen, weisen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gheimbd</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geliebten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhät</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zürich</unclear>.
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heinrich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Brämen</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear> getrüwen
<lb n="37"/>lieben Mitrhat und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sekelmeister</unclear> <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Salomon</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hirtzel</unclear></persName>, unseren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgsandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jetz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halten</unclear>-
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> tag der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jarrechnung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Baden</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ergöw</unclear></placeName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2761_10772.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="41"/>[]
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2761_10773.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2761_10774.jpg" n="4"/>
</p>
